 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Presentation submission: 15 Mar 2027\, 23:59 UTC
 +12 (assumed)\n\nThe call for papers states no timezone. This is counted a
 s UTC+12\, the earliest it could plausibly mean\, so the countdown runs ou
 t before the real deadline rather than after it.\n\nDPSP Europe 2027\, co-
