 ; papers are indexed in IET Inspec\, IEEE Xplore\, Ei Compendex and Scopus
 .\n\nCall for papers: https://dpsp.theiet.org/2027-europe\nDetails: https:
 //powersystemdeadlines.org/conference/dpsp-europe27
